click X Y
choose R C
Enemies come up the road in waves, over the bridge, to the castle gate. Each that reaches it costs a life.
1, 2, 3: choose a tower to build: archer (quick, far), fire (hurts all round its target), ice (slows).
Click open ground to build the tower chosen there, if you have the gold.
Space: send the next wave. Enemies that fall pay gold. See off the last wave to win.
